cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CEL-P5 Metal-on-Metal Cold-Spray Simulation-Surrogate Virtual Twin Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the associated manuscript or this repository."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Kafle, Akash"
date-released: 2026-08-11
keywords:
  - cold spray additive manufacturing
  - Abaqus Explicit
  - coupled Eulerian-Lagrangian
  - simulation surrogate
  - WebXR
  - knowledge graph
license: "NOASSERTION"
abstract: "A gated 44-case metal-on-metal Abaqus/Explicit CEL simulation-surrogate dataset with trained ExtraTrees model, WebXR runtime, knowledge-graph integration notes, and verification reports. The dataset supports qualified-pair simulation-surrogate interpolation only and does not claim experimental validation or universal cross-material prediction."
